<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it raised its rating of Bristol-Myers Squibb Co to long-term accumulate from long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company retained its rating of near-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- The pharmaceutical company closed on Friday at 113-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
